# Feed demo design

When editing the product feed keyword matcher demo or its shopping ad tiles, read and follow:

**`docs/feed-demo-design-preferences.md`**

That doc covers typography (13px/12px tile text, line-height 1.3), colors, stacked card behavior, image rules (no zoom/crop on PNGs), AI Overview placement, automotive sample data, and decisions we iterated on. Do not reintroduce removed patterns (match-note box, availability in automotive feed, tiny overlapping fonts, image scale zoom).
